usage: wechat_pipeline_runner.py [-h] --run-dir RUN_DIR [--url URL]
                                 [--title TITLE] [--target-date TARGET_DATE]
                                 [--effective-trade-date EFFECTIVE_TRADE_DATE]
                                 [--yesterday-run-dir YESTERDAY_RUN_DIR]
                                 [--panel PANEL]
                                 [--image-workers IMAGE_WORKERS]
                                 [--image-retries IMAGE_RETRIES]
                                 [--fetch-mode {http,auto,crawl4ai}]
                                 [--adopt-frozen-package ADOPT_FROZEN_PACKAGE]
                                 [--adopt-package-sha256 ADOPT_PACKAGE_SHA256]
                                 [--adopt-package-id ADOPT_PACKAGE_ID]
                                 [--adopt-input-digest ADOPT_INPUT_DIGEST]
                                 [--legacy-source-summary LEGACY_SOURCE_SUMMARY]
                                 [--legacy-source-manifest LEGACY_SOURCE_MANIFEST]
                                 --stage STAGE [--resume] [--source-only]

公众号管线编排器

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --run-dir RUN_DIR
  --url URL
  --title TITLE
  --target-date TARGET_DATE
  --effective-trade-date EFFECTIVE_TRADE_DATE
  --yesterday-run-dir YESTERDAY_RUN_DIR
  --panel PANEL
  --image-workers IMAGE_WORKERS
                        Fetch image concurrency (1-3 on the Mac intake).
  --image-retries IMAGE_RETRIES
                        Fetch image retries after the first attempt (0-3).
  --fetch-mode {http,auto,crawl4ai}
                        Article HTML transport for the Mac intake.
  --adopt-frozen-package ADOPT_FROZEN_PACKAGE
                        Explicit trusted legacy package ZIP for read-only
                        source revalidation.
  --adopt-package-sha256 ADOPT_PACKAGE_SHA256
                        Externally fixed SHA-256 of the legacy package ZIP.
  --adopt-package-id ADOPT_PACKAGE_ID
                        Package id bound by the trusted ZIP.
  --adopt-input-digest ADOPT_INPUT_DIGEST
                        Input digest bound by the trusted ZIP.
  --legacy-source-summary LEGACY_SOURCE_SUMMARY
                        Original frozen-run summary whose bytes match the ZIP
                        source_intake_sha256.
  --legacy-source-manifest LEGACY_SOURCE_MANIFEST
                        Original frozen-run manifest whose bytes match the ZIP
                        source_manifest_sha256.
  --stage STAGE         , 分隔的 stage 或 all
  --resume              按工件存在跳过已完成 stage
  --source-only         仅 summary 阶段生成 source-only 归档；不允许与
                        build_v3/sync/validate 等阶段混用
